    DEVLABEL["DEVELOPMENT — what actually runs on this machine today"]:::note

    subgraph DEV[" "]
        direction LR
        DBrowser["Browser"] --> ViteDev["Vite dev server — :5173<br/>proxy rule: /api -&gt; http://localhost:3000<br/>(no changeOrigin, no rewrite — deliberate;<br/>'vite preview' on :4173 needs its own<br/>separate preview.proxy entry)"]
        ViteDev --> DevAPI["NestJS — :3000<br/>nest start --watch"]
